OL,3,GNEWSADisabled bridge users lament lack
OL,4,Aof towpath ramp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disability campaigner has joined
OL,7,Fusers of wheelchairs and mobility
OL,8,Fscooters in criticising a new #4.2m
OL,9,Ffootbridge in Long Eaton which does not
OL,10,Foffer full access to the canal towpath
OL,11,Fbelow.
OL,13,FThe crossing which spans the Erewash
OL,14,FCanal to link West Park with the town
OL,15,Fcentre, was opened last month.
OL,17,FWheelchair users are able to cross the
OL,18,Fbridge but there are steps leading to
OL,19,Fthe towpath below which they can not
OL,20,Faccess.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
