OL,3,GNEWSADisabled bridge users lament lack
OL,4,Aof towpath ramp
OL,5,
OL,6,FErewash Borough Council said there was
OL,7,Fnot enough space to install a ramp and
OL,8,Fthe previous bridge also did not offer
OL,9,Faccess to the path.
